<Base title="About" description="What jojojiji is, and who it is for.">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <div class="about-content">
    <p>
      jojojiji is where I write down the things I want my kids to know. Some of it is practical,
      some of it is what I learned the slow way, and some of it is just worth remembering.
    </p>

    <p>
      Anyone is welcome to read along. Comments are open and reviewed before they appear.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
